  "scientific_finding": "For the pinned OProver defaults, independent verification already exceeds available verifier slots. Theorem-affinity local tries can therefore reduce both verifier CPU and idealized batch latency. Replicating each theorem group into otherwise idle verifier slots exposes a selectable CPU-latency Pareto frontier without portable checkpoints.",
